Source: pxvirt-virtio-win
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Lierfang Support Team <itsupport@lierfang.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/virtio-win/kvm-guest-drivers-windows
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pxvirt-virtio-win
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: VirtIO drivers for Windows guests (slim) for PXVirt
 A reduced set of the virtio-win drivers (viostor, vioscsi, NetKVM, Balloon,
 vioserial) for Windows 10/11 and Server 2016-2025 on amd64 and ARM64, plus
 the QEMU guest agent installer.
 .
 The drivers are installed to /usr/share/pve-manager/virtio-win/ and are used
 by the PXVirt autoinstall feature to provide drivers to Windows Setup.

Package: pxvirt-virtio-win-iso
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: VirtIO drivers ISO for Windows guests (slim) for PXVirt
 ISO image with the same reduced set of virtio-win drivers and the QEMU
 guest agent as pxvirt-virtio-win.
 .
 The image is installed as /var/lib/vz/template/iso/pxvirt-virtio-win.iso and
 can be attached to Windows guests as local:iso/pxvirt-virtio-win.iso.
